{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You woke up early to reach the H\u014dkan-ji temple before any other tourists, yet you don't seem to be getting any closer. You've become trapped in an endless loop, and the only way out is to spot what doesn\u2019t belong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631850/extras/loop_en.gif?t=1746111805\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pay close attention to your surroundings. Notice anything wrong? Head left. Everything in order? Go right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631850/extras/stare.gif?t=1746111805\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your path carefully, or be lost forever...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 32 unique anomalies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 different endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fully voice-acted</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631850/extras/coin.gif?t=1746111805\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3631850?t=1746111805","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631850/4fbe9e2ad3b93dbadd492ba58f78bb08f3d9a9b6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746111805","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631850/ea92289bae72e48d7fceae3fd3911b92fc738bd0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746111805","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631850/ea92289bae72e48d7fceae3fd3911b92fc738bd0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746111805","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"des